  logText: 'We have decrypted audio recordings!

    It seems they had a limited
    amount of sounds, which explains the repetition of characters in the texts found
    so far.

    They had around 13 or 14 unique characters, and they follow certain
    patterns. For example, all names appear to begin with a "pr" sound.\nAlso, with
    this audio we learnt their planet''s name! TRAPPIST-1 e shall now be known as
    Proima.'
